# Declared once, centrally — every apps/servers/* chart targets namespace="server-apps" in its
# own helm(...) call (see turbo/generators/templates/server/Tiltfile), but none of their own
# helm/templates/ create the Namespace object itself. Same pattern as services/Tiltfile's own
# "infra" Namespace declaration. The sibling "server-infra" namespace (Postgres/Redis/etc. for
# every server) is Terraform-applied instead (see apps/terraform/main.tf), not declared here.
k8s_yaml(blob("""
apiVersion: v1
kind: Namespace
metadata:
  name: server-apps
"""))

include("./server1-grpc/Tiltfile")
include("./server1-graphql/Tiltfile")
include("./server2-grpc/Tiltfile")
include("./server2-graphql/Tiltfile")
